# Privacy Policy — Screw Puzzle Game

**Effective date:** May 19, 2026

**Last updated:** May 19, 2026

This Privacy Policy describes how **Screw Puzzle Game** ("the App", "we", "us") handles information when you use our mobile application. By using the App, you agree to this policy.

---

## Summary

- We **do not operate a login or user account** in the App. **We do not run our own servers** to store your data.
- Your **game progress and preferences are stored locally** on your device.
- **Google AdMob** may process data to show ads. See Google's disclosures linked below.
- **No in-app purchases** are available in this App.

---

## 1. Who we are

The App is operated by an **independent developer** (publisher of Screw Puzzle Game).

**Contact:** burakbabur.bjk@gmail.com

---

## 2. Information the App processes

The App stores the following **on your device only**:

- **Game progress** — levels completed, puzzle states.
- **App settings** — preferences such as ad-free status.

We **do not** receive this content on our servers.

---

## 3. Advertising (Google AdMob)

The App displays **banner, interstitial, and rewarded ads** via **Google AdMob**.

- Google Privacy Policy: https://policies.google.com/privacy
- How Google uses data from apps: https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites

You may opt out of personalized ads via **Android Settings → Google → Ads**.

---

## 4. Permissions used

- **INTERNET / ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE** — to load ads and game content.
- **AD_ID** — for AdMob ad measurement and personalization.

---

## 5. In-app purchases

The App does **not** offer any in-app purchases or subscriptions.

---

## 6. Children's privacy

The App is not directed at children under 13. Contact us at the email in Section 1 if you have concerns.

---

## 7. International users (EEA / UK / GDPR)

You may exercise data rights (access, erasure, etc.) by clearing app data or uninstalling the App. For ad-related data, use Google's privacy tools.

---

## 8. Changes to this policy

The **"Last updated"** date at the top will change when we update this policy. Continued use means acceptance.

